        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "好"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off leaves the picture as it is. Guided straightens from lines you draw on the picture.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭时保持图片不变。引导会根据你在图片上绘制的线进行校正。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only print dimensions and resolution change. Pixels stay unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅打印尺寸和分辨率改变，像素保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opacity": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不透明度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opacity percent": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不透明度百分比"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Project…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开项目…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Recent": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开最近使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open in a new project tab": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在新项目标签页中打开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open project": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Option temporarily selects the eyedropper in painting tools. Shift constrains shapes/movement or adds to a selection; Option subtracts from selections or draws from center. Command-drag moves selected pixels; Command-Option-drag copies them. Option-drag duplicates layers/folders/effects; Option-click at a layer boundary toggles clipping. Command-click a thumbnail loads its selection. Control bypasses snapping. Right-drag adjusts brush size. Modifier-and-mouse gestures are fixed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在绘画工具中按住 Option 临时选用吸管。Shift 约束形状/移动或添加到选区；Option 从选区减去或以中心绘制。按住 Command 拖动可移动所选像素；按住 Command-Option 拖动可拷贝。按住 Option 拖动可复制图层/图层组/效果；按住 Option 单击图层边界可切换剪贴蒙版。按住 Command 单击缩览图可载入其选区。Control 忽略对齐。按住右键拖动可调整画笔大小。修饰键与鼠标手势固定不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Option-click to set the source": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住 Option 点按以设置源点"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Original %@ histogram": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原始%@直方图"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Original pixels · alpha-weighted histogram": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原图像素 · 透明度加权直方图"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Original pixels · selection and alpha-weighted histogram": {
      "localizations": {
